<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/initiate-long-acting-basal-insulin-for-newly-diagnosed-type-1-diabetes> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Initiate Long Acting Basal Insulin for Newly Diagnosed Type 1 Diabetes" ;
    dmo:populationScope "Those presenting with newly diagnosed type 1 diabetes" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "initiate-long-acting-basal-insulin-for-newly-diagnosed-type-1-diabetes" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Those presenting with newly diagnosed type 1 diabetes should be given long acting basal insulin (e.g. glargine, detemir or degludec - or human NPH insulin, depending on local policy) at a dose of 0.25 units/Kg subcutaneously once daily to mitigate against rebound ketosis when they are taken off the FRIII (68)." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Those presenting with newly diagnosed type 1 diabetes should be given long acting basal insulin (e.g. glargine, detemir or degludec - or human NPH insulin, depending on local policy) at a dose of 0.25 units/Kg subcutaneously once daily to mitigate against rebound ketosis when they are taken off the FRIII (68)." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_02_dka_guideline_with_qr_code_march_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/initiate-resuscitation-and-intensive-monitoring-for-severe-dka> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Initiate resuscitation and intensive monitoring for severe DKA" ;
    dmo:populationScope "individuals with severe DKA" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "initiate-resuscitation-and-intensive-monitoring-for-severe-dka" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "If the individual exhibits any of these signs, resuscitation and treatment should be started without delay, and an intensive monitoring regimen put in place." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "If the individual exhibits any of these signs, resuscitation and treatment should be started without delay, and an intensive monitoring regimen put in place." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_02_dka_guideline_with_qr_code_march_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/initiation-of-fixed-rate-intravenous-insulin-infusion-friii> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Initiation of Fixed Rate Intravenous Insulin Infusion (FRIII)" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "initiation-of-fixed-rate-intravenous-insulin-infusion-friii" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Commence a fixed rate intravenous insulin infusion (FRIII). (0.1unit/kg/hr based on estimate of weight) 50 units human soluble insulin (Actrapid® or Humulin S®) made up to 50ml with 0.9% sodium chloride solution." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Action 2: Commence a fixed rate intravenous insulin infusion (FRIII). (0.1unit/kg/hr based on estimate of weight) 50 units human soluble insulin (Actrapid® or Humulin S®) made up to 50ml with 0.9% sodium chloride solution." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_02_dka_guideline_with_qr_code_march_2023> .

