<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/insulin-may-be-infused-in-the-same-line-as-the-intravenous-replacement-fluid-provided-that-a-y-connector-with-a-one-way-anti-siphon-valve-is-used-and-a-large-bore-cannula-has-been-placed-however-two-large-bore-intravenous-catheters-are-advisable> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Insulin may be infused in the same line as the intravenous replacement fluid provided that a Y connector with a one way, anti-siphon valve is used and a large-bore cannula has been placed. However, two large bore intravenous catheters are advisable" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "insulin-may-be-infused-in-the-same-line-as-the-intravenous-replacement-fluid-provided-that-a-y-connector-with-a-one-way-anti-siphon-valve-is-used-and-a-large-bore-cannula-has-been-placed-however-two-large-bore-intravenous-catheters-are-advisable" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Insulin may be infused in the same line as the intravenous replacement fluid provided that a Y connector with a one way, anti-siphon valve is used and a large-bore cannula has been placed. However, two large bore intravenous catheters are advisable" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Insulin may be infused in the same line as the intravenous replacement fluid provided that a Y connector with a one way, anti-siphon valve is used and a large-bore cannula has been placed. However, two large bore intravenous catheters are advisable" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_02_dka_guideline_with_qr_code_march_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/intravenous-insulin-therapy-may-not-be-required-for-ketonaemia-without-acidosis> a dmo:Recommendation ;
