    dmo:statement "If patient has ketonaemia WITHOUT acidosis (pH≥7.3 or HCO3≥15 mmol/L, intravenous insulin therapy may not be required BUT intravenous fluid hydration and subcutaneous insulin dose correction may be necessary" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "If patient has ketonaemia WITHOUT acidosis (pH≥7.3 or HCO3≥15 mmol/L, intravenous insulin therapy may not be required BUT intravenous fluid hydration and subcutaneous insulin dose correction may be necessary" ;
