<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/specialist-diabetes-team-input-within-24-hours-of-admission> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Specialist diabetes team input within 24 hours of admission" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "specialist-diabetes-team-input-within-24-hours-of-admission" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Referral" ;
    dmo:statement "If they are not already involved, the local diabetes team should be informed and the person with diabetes reviewed within 24 hours of admission. Diabetes team input is important to allow re-education, to reduce the chance of recurrence, and to facilitate appropriate follow up. Hospitals should enable diabetes teams to provide sufficient cover to allow anyone admitted with DKA to be reviewed within 24 hours of admission." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "If they are not already involved, the local diabetes team should be informed and the person with diabetes reviewed within 24 hours of admission. Diabetes team input is important to allow re-education, to reduce the chance of recurrence, and to facilitate appropriate follow up. Hospitals should enable diabetes teams to provide sufficient cover to allow anyone admitted with DKA to be reviewed within 24 hours of admission." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_02_dka_guideline_with_qr_code_march_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/start-a-continuous-friii-via-an-infusion-pump-this-is-made-of-50-units-of-human-soluble-insulin-actrapid-humulin-s-made-up-to-50-ml-with-0-9-sodium-chloride-solution-ideally-this-should-be-provided-as-a-ready-made-solution> a dmo:Recommendation ;
