    dmo:evidenceQuote "Start a continuous FRIII via an infusion pump. This is made of 50 units of human soluble insulin (Actrapid®, Humulin S®) made up to 50 ml with 0.9% sodium chloride solution. Ideally this should be provided as a ready-made solution" ;
