    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Transfer to subcutaneous insulin if the individual is eating and drinking normally. Ensure that the subcutaneous insulin is started before the IV insulin is discontinued. Ideally give the subcutaneous fast acting insulin at a meal and discontinue IV insulin 30-60 minutes later" ;
